{'symbol': 'TER', 'date': '2022-10-25 17:02:00', 'title': 'TERADYNE REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2022 RESULTS', 'text': "NORTH READING, MASS., OCT. 25, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TERADYNE, INC. (NASDAQ: TER) REPORTED REVENUE OF $827 MILLION FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2022 OF WHICH $576 MILLION WAS IN SEMICONDUCTOR TEST, $116 MILLION IN SYSTEM TEST, $46 MILLION IN WIRELESS TEST AND $89 MILLION IN INDUSTRIAL AUTOMATION (IA). GAAP NET INCOME FOR THE THIRD QUARTER WAS $183.5 MILLION OR $1.10 PER DILUTED SHARE. ON A NON-GAAP BASIS, TERADYNE'S NET INCOME IN THE THIRD QUARTER WAS $189.2 MILLION, OR $1.15 PER DILUTED SHARE, WHICH EXCLUDED ACQUIRED INTANGIBLE ASSET AMORTIZATION AND RESTRUCTURING AND OTHER CHARGES."}